# Private secret overlay template.
#
# Copy this file to an ignored operator file such as .env.prod.secrets or
# .env.local.secrets, fill in only the values needed for that environment, and
# build the runtime file with scripts/deploy/build-env-file.py. Never commit
# the copied file or paste secret values into deploy/config/*.env.

